[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ほらヤンネさん、ここに寝転がって！\nラク～な体勢でくつろいじゃってよ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "こ、こうかしら……\nアルビーナ、あなたはちょっとくつろぎすぎじゃない？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "いいの！　今は休暇中で、ここは行楽地なんだから！\nね、ベップ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "姉様の言う通り。\n……二人とも、風を送るわよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ん～！　気持ちいい～！\nこれこれ、これをしたかったんだよねー！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "ありがとうベップちゃん。\nベップちゃんも一緒にくつろぎましょう？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "うん。でも、もう少しこうしてるわ。\n二人が楽しそうなの、嬉しいから",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "分かった、じゃあ後で交代しましょっか。\n私もベップちゃんに風を送りたいから",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "……ただくつろぐだけの時間は慣れないけれど――",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "悪くないわね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "お前たち、おもてなしは無事成功したようだな",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "うん、二人のおかげね。\n姉様もヤンネさんもとても楽しそう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "localized_name": "千歳",
    "romanized_name": "Chitose",
    "model_path_hash": 3924733721061764343,
    "text": "魔物が出た時は、どうなるかと思いましたが……\n楽しまれているようで、何よりです",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4561510886967726962,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "なぁ千歳。向こうの浜にも同じものを用意させたのだ。\n我らも休暇を満喫といこうじゃないか",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "localized_name": "鏑矢",
    "romanized_name": "Kaburaya",
    "model_path_hash": 3738120481696568459,
    "text": "もちろん人払いも済ませてある。\n……余にお前を独り占めさせてくれぬか？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3206719061125087729,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "localized_name": "千歳",
    "romanized_name": "Chitose",
    "model_path_hash": 3924733721061764343,
    "text": "鏑矢様ったら……ふふ。\nはい、ぜひ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4561510886967726962,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "お幸せに～",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "ヤンネさん、今日、楽しかった？",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "ええ、とっても。\n素敵な場所を用意してくれて、ありがとう",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "あなたたちからは、本当に数えきれないほど\n色んなものをもらっちゃってるわね",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "localized_name": "ベップ",
    "romanized_name": "Bepp",
    "model_path_hash": 2719129412126717307,
    "text": "それはこっちのセリフよ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 4522117749578412567,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "そうそう。いつも助けてもらってるし、\nヤンネさんには頼ってばっかりだもん",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "localized_name": "アルビーナ",
    "romanized_name": "Alvina",
    "model_path_hash": 8589968507503775476,
    "text": "これからも頼りにしてるっすよ！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 8874763601186801212,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "ふふ、もちろん、任せてちょうだい",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "localized_name": "ヤンネ",
    "romanized_name": "Janne",
    "model_path_hash": 2318022885960174855,
    "text": "みんなで来られて、よかったわ",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 3552163027021623318,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "localized_name": "ふたり",
    "romanized_name": "",
    "model_path_hash": 0,
    "text": "うん！",
    "voice_file": "",
    "still_path_hash": 0,
    "speech_balloon_type_id": 780292254
  }
]